    {
      "id": "c78c822e7f1e",
      "text": "” “若巨石能挡得住那些想要篡改历史的蝼蚁，那便是必要的代价。",
      "status": "open",
      "first_volume": null,
      "first_chapter": 3,
      "first_title": "l陆意深林既白",
      "mentions": 1,
      "history": [
        {
          "volume": null,
          "chapter_no": 3,
