          "event": "touch",
          "text": "” “若巨石能挡得住那些想要篡改历史的蝼蚁，那便是必要的代价。",
          "updated_at": "2026-05-09T04:47:58Z"
        }
      ],
      "created_at": "2026-05-09T04:47:58Z",
      "last_volume": null,
      "last_chapter": 3,
